# Data — all bulk outputs persisted via GitHub Release "data-latest" tarball
# (parquet + csv + state). Daily workflow no longer commits CSVs to git to
# keep history small. To get fresh data:
#   gh release download data-latest --pattern "etl-data.tar.gz" --dir /tmp
#   tar xzf /tmp/etl-data.tar.gz
